<h1>Training-needs dashboard</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Domain C only — teacher competence (C1), internal PD/mentoring capacity (C3), AI literacy (C4). Sorted by highest training need first, for planning DigiProf-B/-C cohorts and mentor assignments.</p>
<p class="small" style="color:var(--grey);">This is one transparent, disclosed sort on a single, fixed criterion (lowest C1+C3+C4 average) for training-cohort triage — not an automated donor-matching or scoring engine, and not a substitute for a case-by-case look at any specific school.</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>School</th><th>C1 — Teacher competence</th><th>C3 — PD/mentoring capacity</th><th>C4 — AI literacy</th></tr>
  <% rows.forEach(r => { %>
    <tr>
      <td><%= r.school.name %></td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-level<%= r.c1 ?? 0 %>">L<%= r.c1 ?? '—' %></span></td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-level<%= r.c3 ?? 0 %>">L<%= r.c3 ?? '—' %></span></td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-level<%= r.c4 ?? 0 %>">L<%= r.c4 ?? '—' %></span></td>
    </tr>
  <% }) %>
</table>
<% if (rows.length === 0) { %><div class="card"><p>No schools with confirmed data yet.</p></div><% } %>
